<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result for the 2.5 trillion lire auction of a seventh tranche of October 31, 1998 two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ).</p>
<p>			   Oct 31, 1998	Previous</p>
<p>Net Yield		  5.51 pct   vs    5.38 pct</p>
<p>Gross Yield		6.31 pct   vs    6.17 pct</p>
<p>Assigned price	  89.10	 vs   89.10</p>
<p>Bids			5.84 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned		  2.50 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a fifth tranche of October 31, 1998 Ctzs on November 26.</p>
</text>
